{"sections":[{"slug":"单纯对象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"单纯对象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单纯对象"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象是某种空间</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">几何对象</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若要用单纯形</span> $\\Delta^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">来</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">探测</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">一个与</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象类似的空间</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">映射空间</span>” $\\operatorname{Map}(\\Delta^n, X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则会得到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的单纯对象</span> $X\\colon \\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/内部观点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内部</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对偶到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span> $\\Delta^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">类似地</span>, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对偶到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span> $\\Delta_+^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/常值单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">常值单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象的分裂","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象的分裂</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}